Contrast uses within an organization before comparing organizations. Split senses when replacing one occurrence with another changes who must act, which records exist, what is approved or when work counts complete. Keep an example and evidence reference for every sense. A historical organization alias preserves identity and searchability; it does not merge independently defined operational meanings.
